## Next actions

After completing this checklist:

1. For each `wrap/adapter`, draft the adapter interface in your
   downstream codebase.
2. For each `clean-room`, hand the component to the implementation
   team with `handoff/implementation-guide.md` as anchor.
3. For each `don't port`, add an entry to `risk-raw.md` justifying
   the explicit skip (so future audits don't re-litigate).
4. Re-run `validator.py check <system>` to ensure all side-effects
   are coherent.
